window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Sexy, festive and full of Merry and Bright….</p> <p>Pull up a chair and enjoy a snowy Christmas with your favorite Colorado ranchers. </p> <p>It’s December in Poplar Falls and the small town is thrumming with activity and alight with festive cheer. <i>Merry Hearts</i> features all your favorite couples coming together in one story to bring you joy, happiness, and a little Christmas hometown joy. <br> <br> Featuring: <br> Sophie &amp; Braxton (<i>Rustic Hearts</i>) <br> Dallas &amp; Myer (<i>Stone Hearts</i>) <br> Elle &amp; Walker (<i>Wicked Hearts</i>) <br> Bellamy &amp; Brandt (<i>Fragile Hearts</i>) <br> A special surprise from Payne &amp; Charlotte, and your favorite Aunts, Doreen &amp; Ria!</p>"; 
